{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","color":{"standardColorIdentifier":"blue"},"title":"IvorModel","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"IvorModel"}],"externalID":"IvorModel"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"IvorModel is the foundational data-modeling framework for the Ivor music","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ecosystem, providing a representation-agnostic model for musical compositions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written in Swift.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Designed as a flexible composer’s assistant, IvorModel bridges the gap between","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"abstract symbolic notation and physical audio performance through a unified,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dual-paradigm architecture. Compositions are organized as projects containing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"works, each broken into parts with note events, dynamics, panning, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instrumentation — all captured at a level natural to a composer, without being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tied to any particular notation system, audio format, or instrument family."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A template system rounds out the model, enabling analysis of existing works and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithmic generation of new, derived ones. Together these capabilities make it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"straightforward to aggregate, analyze, and transform musical data from disparate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sources before exporting to any destination."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The model is oriented toward Western musical traditions but is not confined to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Western classical music, and aims to accommodate a broader range of musical","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"practice where possible.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import IvorModel","import IvorTiming","import IvorTuning","","\/\/ A work in beat time and standard pitch, with one part.","var work = Work(name: \"Etude\",","                content: .empty(timeBasis: .beat,","                                pitchNotation: .standard))","let melody = try work.addPart(name: \"Melody\")","","\/\/ Seven quarter notes. Beat time counts whole notes, so a quarter note is 1\/4.","let pitches = [\"C4\", \"E4\", \"G4\", \"E4\", \"C4\", \"G3\", \"C4\"]","","try work.modifyPart(melody, as: Part<BeatTime, Pitch>.self) { part in","    var attack = BeatTime.zero","","    for name in pitches {","        part.noteTable.insert(attack: attack,","                              duration: .quarter,","                              pitch: Pitch(plain: name)!)","        attack += .quarter","    }","}","","\/\/ In 3\/4, starting with a one-beat pickup.","try work.modifyMeterTable { table in","    _ = try? table.insert(beatTime: .zero, meter: Meter(plain: \"3\/4\")!)","    try? table.setPickup(.quarter)","}","","\/\/ Transpose it up a fifth, then convert it to wall time and MIDI note numbers.","try work.transpose(by: DirectedInterval(interval: .perfect5,","                                        direction: .ascending))","","let midi = try work.convert(timeBasis: .wall,","                            pitchNotation: .keyboard)!","","\/\/ Learn the melody, and generate a 12-note variation of it.","let template = try Template.analyzeNoteEvents(in: work,","                                              at: 0,","                                              maximumOrder: 2,","                                              name: \"Melody\")","let options  = Template.GenerationOptions<BeatTime, Pitch>(order: 1,","                                                           length: .noteCount(12),","                                                           stopsAtEnd: false)","let variation = try template.generateWork(name: \"Variation\",","                                          partName: \"Melody\",","                                          options: options,","                                          seed: 42)","","\/\/ Keep them in a project, and save it.","var project = Project()","","project.updateWork(work)","project.updateTemplate(template)","","let file = try project.save()               \/\/ a FileWrapper"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/UsingIvorModel","isActive":true},{"text":" for a full guide to works, parts, notes, parameter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"maps, pedals, meters, transforms, conversion, realizations, templates, and projects.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormodel"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/UsingIvorModel"],"title":"Guides","anchor":"Guides"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Project","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Work"],"title":"Projects and works","anchor":"Projects-and-works"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Part","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/NoteTable","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/NoteEvent"],"title":"Parts and notes","anchor":"Parts-and-notes"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Dynamic","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/DynamicMap","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pan","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PanMap"],"title":"Parameter maps","anchor":"Parameter-maps"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Pedal","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PedalTable"],"title":"Pedals","anchor":"Pedals"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Meter","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/MeterTable"],"title":"Meters","anchor":"Meters"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/KeyTable"],"title":"Keys","anchor":"Keys"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Instrument","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/InstrumentTable"],"title":"Instruments","anchor":"Instruments"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/TransformTargets"],"title":"Transforms","anchor":"Transforms"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Realization","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PatchTable","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Patch"],"title":"Realizations","anchor":"Realizations"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Template","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/TemplateDuration","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/TemplatePitch"],"title":"Templates","anchor":"Templates"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Credit","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/RightsNotice","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/Remark"],"title":"Descriptive information","anchor":"Descriptive-information"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/UniqueID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/WorkID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/PartID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/NoteID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/EntryID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/RealizationID","doc:\/\/IvorModel\/documentation\/IvorModel\/TemplateID"],"title":"Identifiers"